🟠 invoices in billing (prod-eu-1) keeps crashing; two possible causes: cluster DNS is not resolving names or its memory limit is too low for normal use. It was killed within 10 seconds of starting. It fails with "dial tcp: lookup db on 10.96.0.10:53: read udp 10.244.1.5:48762->10.96.0.10:53: i/o timeout". Affected: coredns in kube-system; web in shop.
